<p>Ét risikoscenarie pr. startkomponent fra Attack Surface: Entry Point + ATT&amp;CK Technique.</p>
<p>Path Likelihood = MIN af trinene. Scenario Likelihood = MAX af de afsluttede paths. Risk Score = Consequence Index × Scenario Likelihood.</p>
